{"title": "Security drills and arrests before Amarnath Yatra", "summary": "Indian security agencies conducted multiple mock drills in Jammu, Ramban, and Kulgam ahead of the Amarnath Yatra. Simultaneously, several unidentified persons were rounded up during operations linked to counter-insurgency measures.", "summary_points": ["Security forces held multi-agency mock drills at base camps near Bhagwati Nagar and Jammu.", "A separate drill was conducted along National Highway-44 in Ramban.", "The DGP chaired a meeting to review counter-insurgency measures for the pilgrimage route.", "Several unidentified persons were rounded up during security operations in Kulgam.", "Civic bodies are ramping up sanitation and infrastructure preparations."], "title_hi": "अमराणात्र यात्रा से पहले सुरक्षा अभ्यास और गिरफ्तारी", "summary_hi": "अमराणात्र यात्रा के आगे भारतीय सुरक्षा एजेंसी जम्मू, रामबन और कुलगाम में कई प्रशिक्षण अभियान चला रही हैं। साथ ही, विरोधी-आंदोलित उपायों से जुड़े सैन्य कार्यों के दौरान कुछ अज्ञात व्यक्तियों को गिरफ्तार किया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["भगवती नगर और जम्मू के पास आधार कैंप पर बहु-एजेंसी प्रशिक्षण अभियान आयोजित हुआ।", "राष्ट्रीय राजमार्ग-44 में रामबन में एक अलग अभ्यास किया गया।", "अमराणात्र मार्ग के लिए विरोधी-आंदोलित उपायों का समीक्षा करने के लिए DGP ने बैठक की अध्यक्षता की।", "कुलगाम सुरक्षा कार्यों के दौरान कई अज्ञात व्यक्तियों को गिरफ्तार किया गया।", "नगरपालिका शारीरिक सुविधाओं और बुनियादी ढांचे की तैयारी बढ़ा रही है।"], "topic": "Politics", "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Several OGWs rounded up in massive security operations ahead of Amarnath Yatra in Kulgam"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Pahalgam civic body ramps up sanitation, infrastructure ahead of Amarnath Yatra"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https: